                "The first six stages are broadly sequential (Fit it, Own it, Frame it, Get it, Use it, Keep it), while Check it runs throughout.",
                "It spans far more than one lesson: Fit it comes before the lesson, four stages sit within it, and Keep it stretches across the unit and beyond."
